abeling -> page /", "Short and full-scale production runs -> page /", "Standard lead time 2 weeks -> page /", "Same-day quotes, samples, shipping -> page /", "Industries served list -> page /", "ISO 9001:2015 certification -> page /", "cGMP certification -> page /", "HDPE, PCR, Eco Prime, Envision materials -> page /", "Works with inventors from concept to shelf -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Valencia Plastics is a full-service plastic manufacturer specializing in servicing customers for 1 million parts per year and greater.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='valencia-plastics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Valeo''s U.S. was established in Seymour, Indiana, to develop and sell thermal systems to major American automakers. The French multinational expanded through joint ventures with Eaton, Osram Sylvania, and V. Johnson Enterprises, and later acquired Blackstone and ITT Industries, solidifying its North American footprint. A joint venture with Raytheon evolved into Valeo Radar Systems, a wholly owned subsidiary. In 2017, the company added an engineering and innovation center in San Mateo, California.

Today, Valeo USA operates nine production sites, three development centers, and one service center across the country, with its regional headquarters in Troy, Michigan. Its North American plants manufacture a broad range of automotive systems: electrical systems, transmissions, engine management, air management, hybrid and electric vehicle systems, climate control, powertrain thermal systems, compressors, front-end modules, driving assistance, interior controls, interior electronics, lighting, wipers, and wiper motors. The organization is structured around three divisions—Brain, Power, and Light—focused on software-defined vehicles, electrification, and visibility technologies, respectively.

The company serves automotive original equipment manufacturers and the aftermarket through its Valeo Service division. It has earned recognition such as GM Supplier of the Year awards and participates in major industry events including the North American International Auto Show, CES, and South by Southwest.

Valeo states its mission is to make mobility cleaner, safer, and smarter, emphasizing ethics, transparency, empowerment, professionalism, and teamwork in its workplace culture.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automotive electrical systems", "Transmissions", "Engine management", "Air management", "Hybrid and electric vehicle systems", "Climate control", "Powertrain thermal systems", "Compressors", "Front-end modules", "Driving assistance", "Interior controls", "Interior electronics", "Lighting", "Wiper systems", "Wiper motors"], "industries": ["Automotive OEM", "Automotive aftermarket"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Operates 9 production sites, 3 development centers, and 1 service center in the U.S.", "Divisions dedicated to Software Defined Vehicle, electrification, and lighting systems", "GM Supplier of the Year awards", "Engineering and innovation center in San Mateo, California", "Joint ventures with Eaton, Osram Sylvania, and Raytheon"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1980 as Valeo Auto Industries Inc. -> /", "Headquarters in Seymour, Indiana -> db", "9 production sites, 3 development centers, 1 service center in U.S. -> /", "Regional headquarters in Troy, Michigan -> /", "Products: automotive electrical systems, transmissions, engine management, etc. -> /", "Divisions: Brain, Power, Light -> /", "GM Supplier of the Year awards -> /", "Engineering center in San Mateo, California (2017) -> /", "Joint ventures with Eaton, Osram Sylvania, V. Johnson Enterprises, Raytheon -> /", "Acquisitions of Blackstone and ITT Industries -> /", "Mission: make mobility cleaner, safer, smarter -> /", "Workplace values: ethics, transparency, empowerment, professionalism, teamwork -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "North American plants produce the following: automotive electrical systems; transmissions; engine management; air management; hybr