: []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='vapos-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Vasoptic Medical Inc. operates from Columbia, Maryland, where it develops and deploys advanced blood flow imagers and perfusion monitoring systems. The company''s founding year and ownership structure have not been publicly disclosed.

The company''s core products are noninvasive optical imaging systems that capture blood flow dynamics at video rates without the need for contrast agents. These imagers are designed for clinical diagnostics and research applications, providing perfusion data that complements existing angiography methods such as OCT-angiography, fluorescein angiography, and ICG angiography.

The technology generated notable interest at the ARVO 2026 Annual Meeting in Denver, indicating engagement with the vision research community.

The company emphasizes that its video-rate, contrast-free imaging offers a distinct advantage over traditional angiography by revealing real-time blood flow fluctuations over each cardiac cycle, enabling assessments that static imaging cannot provide.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Development of blood flow imagers", "Perfusion monitoring system deployment", "Noninvasive optical imaging", "Video-rate blood flow dynamics capture", "Clinical diagnostic imaging", "Research-grade vascular monitoring"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Ophthalmology", "Clinical diagnostics", "Biomedical research"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Noninvasive optical imaging with no contrast agents required", "Video-rate blood flow dynamics monitoring", "Complements existing angiography technologies (OCT, fluorescein, ICG)", "Designed for both clinical diagnostics and research"], "facts_used": ["Location: Columbia, Maryland -> db", "Develops and deploys advanced blood flow imagers and perfusion monitoring systems -> db", "Uses noninvasive optical imaging technology, no contrast agents required -> /", "Monitors blood flow dynamics at video rates -> /", "Systems used in clinic for diagnostics and research for vascular and blood flow status -> /", "Presented at ARVO 2026 Annual Meeting in Denver -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in the development and deployment of advanced blood flow imagers and perfusion monitoring systems.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='vasoptic-medical-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Vegas Vogue Woodworks operates from a workshop in North Las Vegas, Nevada. The studio was founded by Mert, who believes design starts with how a room should feel. The company focuses on custom furniture and architectural millwork for high-end residential and commercial clients.

The workshop handles design, 3D modeling, CNC fabrication, hand finishing, and installation under one roof. They produce bespoke kitchens, walk-in closets, feature walls, offices, built-ins, and one-of-a-kind furniture pieces. All work is built in-house, from private estates in Laguna Beach and Newport Beach to commercial projects like a restaurant on Fremont Street in Las Vegas.

Clients include homeowners in exclusive neighborhoods across Las Vegas, Los Angeles, and Orange County, as well as commercial clients seeking millwork that withstands heavy use. The studio serves both residential and commercial interior markets.

