UPDATE companies SET description='Vexor Custom Woodworking Tools operates from Denver, Colorado, where it designs and manufactures custom router bits and insert tooling for woodworking applications. The company also provides sharpening, reconditioning, and balancing services for a wide range of cutting tools.

