UPDATE companies SET description='The company produces a wide range of components including optical sensors, power modules in SOT-227 packages, diodes in compact DFN packages, standard rectifiers, bidirectional transient voltage suppressors, position sensor encoders, and both thin-film and thick-film chip resistors. Its product lines also encompass circuit protection solutions such as inrush current limiters and temperature sensors, along with reference designs and design tools to accelerate customer development.

These components serve the automotive, industrial, computing, consumer, telecommunications, military, aerospace, and medical markets, as well as alternative energy applications. Specific automotive-grade optocouplers and MOSFETs, medical-grade MOSFETs, and parts qualified for telecommunications infrastructure are among the documented applications.

