UPDATE companies SET description='Vitrazza is based in Golden, Colorado. In late 2012, the business was acquired by George Pardo, who transformed Glass Solutions Inc. into Vitrazza. Founders Robert Livingston and Bill Fitzgerald had built a local dealer network before retiring.

Vitrazza designs and sells tempered glass chair mats for carpet, hardwood, tile, and other flooring. The product line includes the Prima Collection (8 stock sizes), Moda Collection (12 premium sizes), and the Sola Collection (hand-painted, one-of-a-kind art pieces certified via blockchain). Proprietary features include Invisible Shield® Pro 15 scratch-resistant coating, furniture-quality polished edges with a mini-bevel, Luminoso™ low-iron ultra-clear glass, and the Stabil-a-Dot™ bumper system for stability. The company operates a national distribution center in Golden, CO, and offers same-day shipping for orders placed before 2:30 PM MT. They also sell complementary accessories: hubless office chair wheels, leather footrests, DeskGuard™ glass desk mats, and wood monitor risers.

Vitrazza serves the office furniture and ergonomic accessories markets, targeting both home-office consumers and commercial workplaces. The company sells direct-to-consumer nationwide via eCommerce and also works with dealers.

The company was started to eliminate the irritation of rolling over dented plastic mats, add a designer look to workspaces, and supply the last chair mat a customer ever needs to buy. Vitrazza emphasizes a transferable lifetime warranty, free shipping and returns in the contiguous U.S., and in-house, concierge-style customer service based in Golden, Colorado.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Tempered glass chair mat manufacturing", "Invisible Shield\u00ae Pro 15 coating application", "Furniture-quality polished edges with mini-bevel", "Luminoso\u2122 low-iron ultra-clear glass processing", "Stabil-a-Dot\u2122 bumper system installation", "Hand-painted glass art (Sola Collection)", "Blockchain certification for authenticity and provenance", "Custom glass chair mat design", "Same-day order fulfillment", "Direct-to-consumer eCommerce fulfillment", "DeskGuard\u2122 glass desk mat production", "Hubless office chair wheel assembly", "Leather footrest manufacturing", "Wood monitor riser manufacturing"], "industries": ["Office furniture", "Ergonomic accessories", "Home office", "Commercial office", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Tempered glass", "Low-iron ultra clear glass (Luminoso\u2122)", "Leather", "Wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping for orders placed before 2:30pm MT (Mon-Fri)", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Transferable Lifetime Warranty on glass chair mats and DeskGuards", "Free shipping and returns for all orders in the contiguous U.S.", "Same-day shipping for orders placed before 2:30 PM MT (Mon\u2013Fri)", "In-house, concierge-style customer service located in Golden, Colorado", "Proprietary Invisible Shield\u00ae Pro 15 coating and Stabil-a-Dot\u2122 bumper system"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Golden, Colorado -> db", "Founded circa 2005 in Boulder, CO; transformed to Vitrazza in late 2012 -> /about", "Founders Robert Livingston and Bill Fitzgerald -> /about", "CEO George Pardo acquired b