UPDATE companies SET description='WV Supply operates from its headquarters in Marietta, Ohio, and serves customers across West Virginia, Kentucky, and Ohio through eight branch locations. With over 90 years of experience in electrical distribution, the company has built a regional footprint that supports contractors, industrial operations, facilities, and project teams.

As a full-line electrical distributor, WV Supply stocks more than 20,000 products and represents over 160 manufacturers across core categories that include builder’s products, conduit and fittings, electrical distribution and management, enclosures, hardware, lighting, tools, wire and cable, and wiring devices. Beyond inventory, the company provides a suite of field-focused services: routine and jobsite delivery, 24/7 emergency support, pre-staged deliveries organized by project phase or area, on-site trailer service for immediate crew access, vendor-managed inventory programs, and specialized wire services such as custom cutting, pulling heads, paralleling, color phasing, and staged identification for wire ranging from 20 AWG to 750 MCM. Account tools include credit services, BillPay, ePOD, job-account structures, tax-exempt processing, and ANSI X12 EDI integration.

The customer base spans commercial, institutional, and general construction projects, as well as industrial maintenance and facility operations.

WV Supply’s stated mission is to help customers get their work done profitably. The company emphasizes three commitments — making it happen when conditions change, acting immediately through local teams, and delivering when it matters — guided by values of integrity, excellence, and customer value.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electrical product distribution", "Delivery services", "24/7 emergency services", "Pre-staged deliveries", "On-site trailer service", "Vendor managed inventory", "Wire cutting", "Wire pulling heads", "Wire paralleling", "Wire color phasing", "Wire staging with identification", "Credit services", "BillPay and ePOD billing tools", "Job account and ship-to management", "Tax exempt support", "ANSI X12 EDI integration"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Institutional construction", "General construction", "Industrial operations", "Facilities management", "Electrical contractors"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 emergency material and technical support", "Pre-staged deliveries labeled by project phase or area", "On-site trailer service for direct crew access to materials", "Wire services including cutting, pulling heads, paralleling, color phasing, and staged identification", "ANSI X12 EDI support for automated purchasing workflows"], "facts_used": ["Full-line electrical distributor serving WV, KY, OH -> /", "8 branch locations across three states -> /", "20,000+ products in inventory -> /", "160+ manufacturers represented -> /", "90+ years of experience -> /", "Services: delivery, emergency, pre-staged, on-site trailer, VMI, wire solutions, credit, billing, job accounts, tax exempt, EDI -> /services", "Wire solutions: cutting, pulling heads, paralleling, color phasing, staging, 20 AWG-750 MCM -> /", "Branch list: Huntington WV, Ashland KY, Beckley WV, Gallipolis OH, Hurricane WV, Jackson OH, Marietta OH, Prestonsburg KY -> /", "Manufact