UPDATE companies SET description='Wabash Plastics, Inc. was founded in 1973 in Evansville, Indiana, a city on the border between the Midwest and the South. The company began as an injection molder producing parts for its sister company, Cresline Plastic Pipe Co., before expanding to serve other original equipment manufacturers. Today it operates as part of a family of plastics companies headquartered in Evansville.

The company specializes in custom injection molded components and assemblies, running more than 58 injection molding machines, many configured for two-shot and multi-shot production. Its process portfolio includes gas-assist molding, insert molding, stack molding, fan and blower molding with balancing, and in-mold labeling and applique. In-house decoration capabilities cover pad printing, hot stamping, heat transfer, roll-on hot stamping, and part marking. Assembly services range from custom cells and robotic cobots to ultrasonic, vibration, spin, infrared, and hot-plate welding, plus foam-in-place gaskets and leak testing.

Wabash serves appliance, automotive, HVAC, point-of-purchase, and consumer-goods OEMs across North America. The company emphasizes reshoring and nearshoring, positioning its Midwest location as a way to shorten supply chains and improve oversight.

Wabash cites its ISO 9001:2015 certification and a history of supplier performance awards as evidence of its focus on cost competitiveness, quality, and on-time project launches. The firm says it measures results by shortening design cycles, lowering production costs, and improving product quality.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection Molding", "2K/Two-shot/Overmolding", "Gas Assist Injection Molding", "Insert Molding", "Stack Molding", "Fan/Blower Molding & Balancing", "In-Mold Labeling & Applique", "Pad Printing", "Hot Stamp & Heat Transfer", "Roll-On Hot Stamping", "Part Marking", "Custom Assembly Cells", "Robotic Assembly", "Cobots", "Ultrasonic Welding", "Vibration Welding", "Spin Welding", "IR Infrared Welding", "Hot Plate Welding", "Foam In Place Gaskets", "Leak Testing / Pressure Decay", "Materials Selection"], "industries": ["Appliance", "Automotive", "HVAC", "Point of Purchase", "Consumer Goods"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 58 injection molding machines with multi-shot capability", "ISO 9001:2015 certified", "Reshoring and nearshoring focus", "In-house decoration and assembly including robotic cells", "Supplier performance awards for quality and cost competitiveness"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1973 -> /about", "Headquartered in Evansville, Indiana -> /about", "Started as injection molder for sister company Cresline Plastic Pipe Co. -> /about", "Part of a family of plastics companies -> /about", "Over 58 injection molding machines, many multi-shot -> /about", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /about", "Supplier performance awards for cost competitiveness, quality, on-time launches -> /about", "Industries served: appliance, automotive, HVAC, point of purchase, consumer goods -> /about", "Capabilities: 2K/two-shot/overmolding, gas assist, insert molding, stack molding, fan/blower molding & balancing, in-mold labeling & applique, pad printin