UPDATE companies SET description='Washington Workplace operates from Arlington, Virginia, serving the Washington, D.C., Maryland, and Virginia corridor as well as clients nationwide. The company functions as an office furniture dealership, supplying contract furnishings and delivering a suite of workplace design services.

Its core offering combines product sales with end-to-end project execution. Services include space planning and design, budgeting, project management, furniture installation, office maintenance, and storage solutions.

