UPDATE companies SET description='Today the business is led by Chairman Clif McKenzie, President CK McKenzie, and Board Member Kathy McKenzie.

The company designs and manufactures furniture for two primary segments: modern office environments (desks, tables, systems, and storage) and mission-critical consoles for 24/7 control rooms and emergency communications centers. Production processes include a PFAS-free, heat-cured electrostatically applied coating, polypropylene edge banding as a PVC-free standard, and thermally fused low-pressure laminate fabrication.

Customers include corporate offices, government agencies, and public-safety organizations that require durable, purpose-built furniture for high-stakes, round-the-clock operations. The firm’s pivot to mission-critical work began in 1986 when a local emergency communications center commissioned custom consoles, establishing a specialization that now runs alongside its commercial office line.

