UPDATE companies SET description='Wegner Custom Furniture was founded in 2015 by Joe Wegner in Huntington Beach, California, before relocating to Conifer, Colorado in February 2017. The company, owned and operated by Wegner, grew from a backyard project building a bed and dining table into a full-time custom furniture business after early Craigslist orders demonstrated demand. In August 2024, the operation expanded to the Big Sky, Montana area.

Working primarily in hickory and reclaimed timber, the team handles design, joinery, finishing, and assembly for one-off residential pieces and commercial projects. No facility size or headcount figures are published.

Clients range from homeowners and interior designers to custom home builders across Colorado, Idaho, Wisconsin, Montana, Minnesota, California, Maryland, Texas, and New Mexico.

