UPDATE companies SET description='Wepco Plastics, Inc. has operated from Middlefield, Connecticut, for more than 35 years. The company traces its roots to founder Waldo Parmelee, who started the business with a single toolmaker. Today it remains family-owned, with leadership including President David Parmelee and Vice Presidents Amanda Wiriya and Jeff Maier.

The shop specializes in prototype and short-to-medium-run plastic injection molding, backed by in-house tooling that enables a three-week tooling turnaround. The facility employs over 30 people and stands behind a 50,000-part guarantee on its molds.

