UPDATE companies SET description='West Michigan Food Equipment operates from Zeeland, Michigan, as a family-owned supplier of commercial food equipment. The business is led by Marcus, who grew up in the industry and runs the company with his family. While a specific founding year is not disclosed, the team brings over 25 years of combined experience in food service equipment.

