UPDATE companies SET description='White Space operates from Reno, Nevada, and has spent two decades turning high-stakes hospitality visions into reality. The company has delivered projects for brands such as Ritz‑Carlton, Disney, Kate Spade, Soho House, and Outrigger across locations from New York to Tel Aviv, California to Hawaii.

