UPDATE companies SET description='White Wolf Custom Apparel is a family-owned custom apparel and promotional products shop based in Little Falls, Minnesota. The company serves businesses, teams, and events across Central Minnesota, including Brainerd, St. Cloud, Little Falls, Sartell, Sauk Rapids, and surrounding communities. The shop describes itself as built for brands that refuse to blend in, moving fast and delivering like a powerhouse while maintaining a family-owned approach.

