UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1983 in Madison, Alabama, Wildwood Electronics is a woman-owned small business that has specialized in high-reliability contract manufacturing and build-to-print electronics production for the aerospace and defense sectors. Over four decades of experience, the company has built a reputation for delivering complex, mission-critical hardware to the Department of Defense, NASA, and prime contractors, supporting some of the nation''s most advanced defense and space programs.

